# Licence

Data in this repository is published under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (OGL).

It is derived from openly-licensed public sources — the police.uk `/forces` API, ONS Police Force Areas (December 2025) Names and Codes, and the UK government-organisation register (GB-GOR) — all OGL.

Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
See https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/
